# KSV-0110: Deployment uses default namespace — intentional for this single-service
# demo project. E2E tests deploy to default namespace via KinD.
KSV-0110

# KSV-0125: Image uses ghcr.io (GitHub Container Registry) — this is our own registry,
# not untrusted. Trivy's default trusted registries list doesn't include ghcr.io.
KSV-0125

# KSV-0011: no CPU limit, deliberately. A 10m limit (1 ms of CPU per 100 ms) stretched reclaim
# and start-up into multi-second stalls that failed liveness probes (117 restarts in 46 h, measured).
KSV-0011
